{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Midnight Biohazard is a first person choice based psychological horror game set in the depths of an abandoned mining site in the Skull Mountains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employer sent you to clean up the Skull Mountains mining site after it was abandoned due to a new liquid being found in the mines, making everyone die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However... There are things in the woods you will wish you never saw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make can and <strong>WILL</strong> affect your story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.poster.avif?t=1772053524\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.webm?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.mp4?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Creatures</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you make can be a last one. The creatures see you. The creatures want you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THEY WANT YOUR EYES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/a166aae7ecb0254fd36c1a506c01cd3c.poster.avif?t=1772053524\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/a166aae7ecb0254fd36c1a506c01cd3c.webm?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/a166aae7ecb0254fd36c1a506c01cd3c.mp4?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the mining site area, you will stumble upon many challanges in all kinds of forms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fire a revolver or hit with an axe when you're in danger. However a simple choice is what can save you most of the time. This game has many <strong>interactable cutscenes</strong> with hard choices and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/153b468b30a3bdb5083d4246f467fdf0.poster.avif?t=1772053524\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/153b468b30a3bdb5083d4246f467fdf0.webm?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/153b468b30a3bdb5083d4246f467fdf0.mp4?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714300?t=1772053524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/34f7d318c2caddcf979f8b4ceae3c2741dc7b977/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772053524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/3a62e0108c944d47444402bf08225d157d31edac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772053524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/3a62e0108c944d47444402bf08225d157d31edac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772053524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features a lot of blood, flesh and deaths."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Midnight Biohazard is a first person choice based psychological horror game set in the depths of an abandoned mining site in the Skull Mountains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employer sent you to clean up the Skull Mountains mining site after it was abandoned due to a new liquid being found in the mines, making everyone die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However... There are things in the woods you will wish you never saw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make can and <strong>WILL</strong> affect your story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.poster.avif?t=1772053524\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.webm?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/5c3a8720dd64536674e7993c9adf3bfe.mp4?t=1772053524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Creatures</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you make can be a last one. The creatures see you. The creatures want you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THEY WANT YOUR EYES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/a166aae7ecb0254fd36c1a506c01cd3c.poster.avif?t=1772053524\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/a166aae7ecb0254fd36c1a506c01cd3c.webm?t=1772053524\" type=\"